# Base URL for API calls.
#
# Leave it UNSET for local development: api.ts then falls back to a relative "/api",
# and the Vite dev server proxies that to the backend (see vite.config.ts), which keeps
# everything same-origin and avoids CORS entirely.
#
# Set it for a production build only when the API lives on another origin - which is the
# case on GitHub Pages, since Pages cannot proxy anything. Scheme, host and port, no
# trailing slash. The value is baked in at build time, so changing it needs a rebuild.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
